m/v/t64.5771-25/499619174_863677183181883_7072938729439825905_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B3Cvj1E719wQ7kNvwHmOey7&_nc_oc=AdoUn7B158cIgtJC_gy9I8E4AlI8493J5JOBjB11Xm2l9QMTxDVzpuR2_vHedGa3HZo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAESqiGm42Dea3xtJzlbcKl1EfxBOXAtWvYbGiGchSmdw&oe=6A69EE61"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "1421031619553061", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619681_1421031622886394_6705460645077643757_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=isPth-fyVIwQ7kNvwFAb80m&_nc_oc=AdpJ1Piu8w0XD48qRl_RwGDxw2Shr8eDxvm7q2TfDBlymacJLIRsI9aaz37fqSSOrWo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDw6dM9oD_IWhuHQxQ3zTBfWJgKY6qEbpqOZ2klG90-Eg&oe=6A69E5FB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Webshift.png", "id": "1523057948767778", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619078_1523057952101111_2831137810012308654_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V1jH7I134fgQ7kNvwHEmYSZ&_nc_oc=AdqVgM7-gatsssnkhADywcfwNP4obrgjAjPZPcax5FfPDaWXdfOYgLN_EjEpGlIVRVQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBw_doeXFP17hcZ5czKaGSkyYswGrLJvLUC-xVZDnO3gA&oe=6A69EB4A"}, "display_name": "Webshift: Spider Shadow", "keywords": ["horror", "vrhorror", "spider", "survival", "escaperoom"], "long_description": "Webshift: Spider Shadow is a short VR horror experience focused on atmosphere, exploration, and tense encounters.\nMove through claustrophobic spaces, search for a way forward, and stay alert \u2014 something is watching from the dark.\nEstimated playtime: ~5\u201315 minutes (single playthrough).\nComfort: standing.\nRecommended: headphones.", "short_description": "A short VR horror experience: explore dark corridors, survive sudden encounters, and uncover what\u2019s hiding in the shadows."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "877888348297238", "locale": "ru_RU", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Webshift: Spider Shadow", "keywords": ["horror", "vrhorror", "spider", "escaperoom", "survival"], "long_description": "Webshift: Spider Shadow \u2014 \u043a\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0442\u043a\u0438\u0439 VR-\u0445\u043e\u0440\u0440\u043e\u0440 \u0441 \u0443\u043f\u043e\u0440\u043e\u043c \u043d\u0430 \u0430\u0442\u043c\u043e\u0441\u0444\u0435\u0440\u0443, \u0438\u0441\u0441\u043b\u0435\u0434\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0438 \u043d\u0430\u043f\u0440\u044f\u0436\u0451\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u043c\u043e\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442\u044b.\n\u041f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u0438\u0440\u0430\u0439\u0441\u044f \u043f\u043e \u0442\u0435\u0441\u043d\u044b\u043c \u043a\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0434\u043e\u0440\u0430\u043c, \u0438\u0449\u0438 \u043f\u0443\u0442\u044c \u0432\u043f\u0435\u0440\u0451\u0434 \u0438 \u043d\u0435 \u0442\u0435\u0440\u044f\u0439 \u0431\u0434\u0438\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c \u2014 \u0432 \u0442\u0435\u043c\u043d\u043e\u0442\u0435 \u043a\u0442\u043e-\u0442\u043e \u043d\u0430\u0431\u043b\u044e\u0434\u0430\u0435\u0442.\n\u0412\u0440\u0435\u043c\u044f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0445\u043e\u0436\u0434\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f: ~5\u201315 \u043c\u0438\u043d\u0443\u0442 (\u0437\u0430 \u043e\u0434\u0438\u043d \u0437\u0430\u0445\u043e\u0434).\n\u041a\u043e\u043c\u0444\u043e\u0440\u0442: \u0441\u0442\u043e\u044f.\n\u0420\u0435\u043a\u043e\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0434\u0443\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f: \u043d\u0430\u0443\u0448\u043d\u0438\u043a\u0438.", "short_description": "\u041a\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0442\u043a\u0438\u0439 VR-\u0445\u043e\u0440\u0440\u043e\u0440: \u0438\u0441\u0441\u043b\u0435\u0434\u0443\u0439 \u0442\u0451\u043c\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u043a\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0434\u043e\u0440\u044b, \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0436\u0438\u0432\u0438 \u0432\u043d\u0435\u0437\u0430\u043f\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0432\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0435\u0447\u0438 \u0438 \u0443\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0439, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u0441\u043a\u0440\u044b\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f \u0432 \u0442\u0435\u043c\u043d\u043e\u0442\u0435."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "786857423787697", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Webshift: Spider Shadow", "keywords": ["horror", "vrhorror", "spider", "survival", "escaperoom"], "long_description": "Webshift: Spider Shadow est une courte exp\u00e9rience VR d\u2019horreur ax\u00e9e sur l\u2019atmosph\u00e8re, l\u2019exploration et la tension.\nAvance dans des espaces \u00e9troits, cherche une issue et reste sur tes gardes \u2014 quelque chose t\u2019observe dans le noir.\nDur\u00e9e : ~5\u201315 minutes (une partie).\nConfort : debout.\nRecommand\u00e9 : casque audio.", "short_description": "Une courte exp\u00e9rience VR d\u2019horreur : explore des couloirs sombres, survis \u00e0 des rencontres soudaines et d\u00e9couvre ce qui se cache dans l\u2019ombre."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1529626781431759", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Webshift: Spider Shadow", "keywords": ["horror", "vrhorror", "spider", "survival", "escaperoom"], "long_description": "Webshift: Spider Shadow ist ein kurzes VR-Horror-Erlebnis mit Fokus auf Atmosph\u00e4re, Erkundung und spannungsgeladene Momente.\nBewege dich durch enge Bereiche, suche einen Ausweg und bleib wachsam \u2014 in der Dunkelheit beobachtet dich etwas.\nSpielzeit: ca. 5\u201315 Minuten (ein Durchlauf).\nKomfort: Stehend.\nEmpfohlen: Kopfh\u00f6rer.", "short_description": "Ein kurzes VR-Horror-Erlebnis: erkunde dunkle G\u00e4nge, \u00fcberlebe pl\u00f6tzliche Begegnungen und finde heraus, was im Schatten lauert."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1310873160788684", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Webshift: Spider Shadow", "keywords": ["horror", "vrhorror", "spider", "survival", "escaperoom"], "long_description": "Webshift: Spider Shadow \u00e9 uma curta experi\u00eancia de terror em VR com foco em atmosfera, explora\u00e7\u00e3o e momentos de tens\u00e3o.\nAtravesse espa\u00e7os claustrof\u00f3bicos, procure um caminho adiante e fique atento \u2014 algo est\u00e1 observando no escuro.\nTempo estimado: ~5\u201315 minutos (uma jogada).\nConforto: em p\u00e9.\nRecomendado: fones de ouvido.", "short_description": "Uma curta experi\u00eancia de terror em VR: explore corredores escuros, sobreviva a encontros repentinos e descubra o que se esconde nas sombras."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "914276194511783", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Webshift: Spider Shadow", "keywords": ["horror", "vrhorror", "spider", "survival", "escaperoom"], "long_description": "Webshift: Spider Shadow es una breve experiencia de terror en VR centrada en la atm\u00f3sfera, la exploraci\u00f3n y la tensi\u00f3n.\nAvanza por espacios claustrof\u00f3bicos, busca una salida y mantente alerta \u2014 algo te observa desde la oscuridad.\nDuraci\u00f3n estimada: ~5\u201315 minutos (una partida).\nComodidad: de pie.\nRecomendado: auriculares.", "short_description": "Una breve experiencia de terror en VR: explora pasillos oscuros, sobrevive a encuentros repentinos y descubre qu\u00e9 se esconde en las sombras."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://multiverse-lore1.netlify.app/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "LCSS", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://webshiftssh.netlify.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED